<!-- [[ARABIC_HEADER]] هذا الملف (views/partials/notification-center.ejs) جزء من مشروع HM CAR ويحتوي تعليقات عربية لضمان الوضوح. -->

<div class="notification-center" id="notificationCenter">
  <div class="notification-header">
    <h6><i class="fas fa-bell"></i> الإشعارات</h6>
    <div class="notification-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="markAllRead">
        تعليم الكل كمقروء
      </button>
      <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger" id="clearAll">
        مسح الكل
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="notification-filters">
    <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all">الكل</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="unread">غير مقروءة</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="auction">المزادات</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="message">الرسائل</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="order">الطلبات</button>
  </div>
  
  <div class="notification-list" id="notificationList">
    <div class="notification-loading">
      <div class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm" role="status">
        <span class="visually-hidden">تحميل...</span>
      </div>
      جاري تحميل الإشعارات...
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="notification-footer">
    <button class="btn btn-link" id="loadMoreNotifications">
      تحميل المزيد
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.notification-center {
  position: fixed;
  top: 60px;
  left: auto;
  right: 20px;
  width: 400px;
  max-height: 600px;
  background: var(--background-color);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  border-radius: var(--border-radius);
  box-shadow: var(--gold-shadow);
  display: none;
  flex-direction: column;
  z-index: 1002;
}

.notification-center.active {
  display: flex;
}

.notification-center .notification-header {
  padding: 15px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}

.notification-center .notification-header h6 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--primary-color);
}

.notification-center .notification-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 5px;
}

.notification-center .notification-filters {
  padding: 10px 15px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  display: flex;
  gap: 5px;
  overflow-x: auto;
}

.notification-center .filter-btn {
  padding: 5px 10px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  background: var(--background-color);
  border-radius: 15px;
  font-size: 12px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s;
}

.notification-center .filter-btn:hover {
  background: var(--accent-color);
}

.notification-center .filter-btn.active {
  background: var(--primary-color);
  color: #fff;
  border-color: var(--primary-color);
}

.notification-center .notification-list {
  flex: 1;
  overflow-y: auto;
}

.notification-center .notification-item {
  padding: 15px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 0.2s;
  position: relative;
}

.notification-center .notification-item:hover {
  background: var(--accent-color);
}

.notification-center .notification-item.unread {
  background: var(--section-bg-color);
  border-right: 3px solid var(--primary-color-light);
}

.notification-center .notification-item.unread::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 20px;
  right: 10px;
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  background: var(--primary-color-light);
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.notification-center .notification-content {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 10px;
}

.notification-center .notification-icon {
  width: 35px;
  height: 35px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  background: var(--section-bg-color);
  color: var(--primary-color);
}

.notification-center .notification-icon.success { color: var(--success-color); }
.notification-center .notification-icon.warning { color: var(--warning-color); }
.notification-center .notification-icon.error { color: var(--danger-color); }
.notification-center .notification-icon.auction { color: var(--warning-color); }
.notification-center .notification-icon.message { color: var(--primary-color-light); }
.notification-center .notification-icon.order { color: var(--success-color); }
.notification-center .notification-icon.system { color: var(--text-color-secondary); }

.notification-center .notification-details {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}

.notification-center .notification-title {
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 5px;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--primary-color);
}

.notification-center .notification-message {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text-color-secondary);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

.notification-center .notification-time {
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--text-color-secondary);
}

.notification-center .notification-action {
  margin-top: 8px;
}

.notification-center .notification-action button {
  padding: 4px 12px;
  font-size: 12px;
  border-radius: 15px;
}

.notification-center .notification-loading {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 40px;
  color: var(--text-color-secondary);
}

.notification-center .notification-empty {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 40px;
  color: var(--text-color-secondary);
}

.notification-center .notification-footer {
  padding: 10px 15px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  text-align: center;
}

.notification-center .notification-footer button {
  color: var(--primary-color);
